Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on
25/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to write the colony exports

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

On inferred links
-----------------

The Mycelium prompt asks for on-device embeddings (a small sentence-embedding model) to infer
links between notes. There is no embedding model in this estate, so Decay does not infer links:
every link is explicit, made by the person. The vitality model therefore counts only links that
were decided, which is a smaller claim than the prompt's and an honest one.
